# Note: go.mod and go.sum are intentionally NOT ignored.
# They must be committed when Go source is present in this repo.
.claude/
# The standing agent instructions no longer live in this repository. They were
# moved to a private one so that no assistant-config filename or content travels
# with the public source. Recover the last tracked copy with
# `git show c81e0b5f:CLAUDE.md` if it is ever needed.

# npm workspace for the screenshot capture tooling (scripts/screenshot.mjs).
node_modules/

# Scratch file written by the VayuShield real-IP reconciler; never a repo artifact.
cmd/vayupress/realip.skipped
realip.skipped

# Security-audit working files. Deliberately NOT committed: this repository is
# public, and these files hold unverified attack write-ups against code that is
# running on live installs. Publishing them is handing an attacker the roadmap
# before the fixes exist. Findings reach the repo as FIXES plus their regression
# tests, and as CHANGELOG entries that name the mechanism — never as a list of
# open holes. Coordinate anything further through SECURITY.md.
security-audit/
